":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/wet-areas-24-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmoAAABXRUJQVlA4IF4AAABQAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJYwC7AYvDzFshGwrlsAA/onMVb1zDNqdr5WReGWxbgHy4mixmf+AH4sxpVlcRJQ8WbEOGcYi3wfwynXeVzwsUFcrSq1HrRUL0VWdiL1SIAAA"},"imageSecondary":null,"video":null,"videoSecondary":null},{"type":"section-intro","heading":"In collaboration","subheading":"Philosophy","content":"<p>Shaped through a close working relationship between design and delivery, Calibre reflects a highly considered approach to balancing architectural intent with practical execution. The Rob Kennon Architects project team helped navigate a complex brief with clarity, resolving site constraints, planning requirements, and long-term client needs into a cohesive and enduring outcome. A strong focus on proportion, restraint, and detailing underpins the design, resulting in a residence that feels resolved, confident, and quietly sophisticated in its expression.</p>\n","cta":false,"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"image-three-column","images":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoxNzM=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Image_3-1-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":3200,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlIAAABXRUJQVlA4IEYAAAAQAgCdASoQAA0AA4BaJZQCdAELz7Q6RYAAAP7139YY96wMBN1/P9+SYEPF6a5KjySV0gjUeF+4ryPg9G/9ao1p7zlnlAAA"},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNjc=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-collaborators-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2667,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnQAAABXRUJQVlA4IGgAAAAQAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJQBOgMYO2DQpwSwAAP7YePSOCCWbMJU0l/K/sHO8j9h5tO//bNerVZcj/o5zYJL5FfmNcdbsgrdf03jsTknI2I38YU9wB7lEDzMLPnsYak2x8/MKQvmv9cAAAA=="},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNzU=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/wet-areas-17-1-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkoAAABXRUJQVlA4ID4AAADQAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZQC7AC6vmrYAAD+UwDbdeqUtRyjlv588MArfAY8AL11HBh6NzLU/KcVGADhCQAAAA=="},"video":false}]},{"type":"list-carousel","heading":"Project Highlights","description":"Designed for downsizing without compromise, Calibre delivers a highly functional, light-filled residence surrounded by city skyline views from an elevated site. Multiple living zones, integrated vertical circulation and a flexible basement level help provide long-term adaptability, while skylights and full-height glazing bring natural light deep into the home. A refined materials palette, concealed façade detailing and considered lighting complete a residence that is both practical and architecturally resolved.","panels":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNTc=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/living-dining-entertainment-areas-28-1-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmoAAABXRUJQVlA4IF4AAABQAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZACdAYtLq/WymfunwAA/rS3yRssqJYvaTP9J0J0mJUpZ7n0H2cUfDzCQBmQYieOGZWvKjbdLmBgOjw5WjlgV8S7g4wq/c55ToTA0Xc2gWAA"},"description":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNzY=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Kitchen-area-4-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlwAAABXRUJQVlA4IFAAAADwAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZACw7C3y7vm18AA/P9ZlR/MZw0T5xYIKTdR9AP+iTaqrI/C5MVDldQXAvpp5aceyN0pCCdGzUNetWjuBHJfowAAAA=="},"description":false}],"list":[{"label":false,"value":false},{"label":false,"value":false}]}],"pageData":{"title":"Calibre","parents":[],"featuredImage":false,"colorTheme":"light","projectData":{"heading":"A carefully resolved design shaped with Sabs Architecture, for a residence that balances long-term functionality with refined, low-maintenance living. ","content":"<p>Calibre was shaped by a desire to create a home that supports ease of living over time, without compromising on quality or experience. Responding to the sloping site, the design maximises light, views and spatial flow while integrating accessibility through features such as an internal lift and adaptable living zones. A restrained material palette and seamless detailing reinforce a sense of quiet sophistication, ensuring the home is both enduring and effortlessly liveable.</p>\n","mainImage":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNTI=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Kitchen-area-24-1-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmYAAABXRUJQVlA4IFoAAAAwAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZACdADPoBkDw2VzwAD+J7Bx6bMpzOXXi5YBnGl3DWZ8BfGUSktNQvOeEJAjkoQVGMzAHppRDlW76rWFf0WLP+6raYsRairh5UkcAAA="},"video":false,"details":[{"label":"Name","value":"Calibre"},{"label":"Status","value":"Completed 2025"},{"label":"Location","value":"Aberfeldie, Melbourne"},{"label":"Architect","value":"Sabs Architecture"}],"nextPost":{"heading":"Small House","description":false,"label":"2024","link":{"target":false,"title":"Small House","url":"/projects/small-house/"},"image":{"sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/10.-20230807_R-Architecture_Hanover-St_054.jpg","alt":"","width":"1429","height":"2000","blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRpgAAABXRUJQVlA4IIwAAAAQBACdASoQABYAPu1iqU2ppaQiMAgBMB2JYgC7ACHKVckQ1rL87gjVAAD+8CwpawKM24Mk/VJI+QzbnI1KZzEyEP06eRIddSqiyjFcOnnNVPpKdB1s/lNcVyDLPPkq2Tob/elW62A3AA69Z3/BkzcEo3Z6qH835lH1u6Vi5C6k1xLpPSq2XEwuqQAAAA=="},"videoUrl":false}}},"postType":"Project"}}}